                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>ika n' a:t titai, ke:yeh *porque** ne:, yeh pos nochi ahsi moihtik, nochi kahsiti mo..., mo..., tein ika tike:wa motakwal</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
